  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/parca1.png\" alt=\"圖片1\" width=\"24%\" />\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/parca2.png\" alt=\"圖片2\" width=\"24%\" />\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/parca3.png\" alt=\"圖片3\" width=\"24%\" />\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/parca4.png\" alt=\"圖片4\" width=\"24%\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/readme.gif\" alt=\"動畫圖片\" />\n</p>\n\n![替代文字](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/image1.png)\n\n## 想閱讀其他語言的版本嗎？\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/gb.svg\" alt=\"英文\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/tr/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/tr.svg\" alt=\"土耳其文\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/de/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/de.svg\" alt=\"德文\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/es/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/es.svg\" alt=\"西班牙文\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/fr/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/fr.svg\" alt=\"法文\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/ja/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/jp.svg\" alt=\"日文\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/ko/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/kr.svg\" alt=\"韓文\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/pt-br/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/br.svg\" alt=\"葡萄牙文（巴西）\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/ru/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/ru.svg\" alt=\"俄文\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/languages/zh-cn/readme.md\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icon-css/3.5.0/flags/4x3/cn.svg\" alt=\"中文\" width=\"40\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n\n# Safra 🚀\n\n別浪費時間處理伺服器設定或多餘的步驟  \n**點擊兩次**即可啟動你的 Minecraft 伺服器，直接跳進遊戲\n\n✅ 沒有複雜的介面 😌  \n✅ 沒有不必要的系統 🚫  \n✅ 輕量且最佳化 ⚡  \n\n![替代文字](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/screenshot2.png)\n\n> 預覽中使用 **TLauncher**（支援其他啟動器）  \n> 包含**語音聊天**支援（模組支援）\n\n## 模組支援\n\n你可以輕鬆和你與朋友安裝的模組一起遊玩  \n支援 **Fabric**、**Forge** 和 **NeoForge**\n\n## 注意事項 ⚠️\n\n> 如果有 TLauncher 或其他啟動器的玩家加入，只需讓開啟伺服器的人在分享遊戲前設定 `online-mode=false` 即可。\n\n![替代文字](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/screenshot3.png)\n\n> 如果你想讓生成的代碼保持固定，只需在設定中將 `Use Fixed Code=on` 開啟即可。\n\n![替代文字](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/screenshot8.png)\n\n## 常見問題 🤔\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/refs/heads/assets/png/emoji1.png\" alt=\"常見問題表情\" width=\"100%\" />\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"70%\" align=\"left\">\n      ✨ 需要某個功能、有版本建議，或發現了錯誤？<br />\n      你可以透過 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/NHjBvRxDXP\">Discord</a> 聯絡我們<br /><br />\n      ❤️ 這是開源專案，存放於此<br />\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra\">DeveloperKubilay/Safra</a><br /><br />\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/DeveloperKubilay/Safra/blob/assets/how_it_works.md\">👀 想了解運作原理嗎？</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
